## 5.2 Existing LAN Hardware-Switch Interface

``` fortigate
config system interface
    edit "internal"
        set ip 192.168.5.1 255.255.255.0
        set allowaccess ping https ssh fabric
        set type hard-switch
        set alias "LAN"
        set stp enable
        set role lan
    next
