### Explanation

-   `internal` is a hard-switch interface.
-   It has the IP address `192.168.5.1/24`.
-   HTTPS and SSH management access are enabled.
-   This interface is also used as the parent interface for
    `FW-TRANSIT`.

> Before modifying `internal`, verify which physical ports belong to
> this hardware switch and whether any active devices depend on its
